{"3886590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pharma Noctis", "steam_appid": 3886590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pharma Noctis</strong> is a psychological horror without jump scares, where an ordinary night shift in a pharmacy turns into something disturbing and inevitably frightening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are just a pharmacist. You fill prescriptions, check orders, prepare medicines, and keep records. But as the night drags on, it feels more and more like something is watching you from the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no screams or chases — only the night, which won’t let you go until your shift ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886590/extras/e5996e4bfe73c9bf1a6b622fe2cefb50.avif?t=1771490394\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886590/extras_big/e5996e4bfe73c9bf1a6b622fe2cefb50.webp?t=1771490394 width=1560 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pharma Noctis</i> blends the atmosphere of psychological horror with the quiet, almost meditative routine of a pharmacist’s work.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the uneasy calm of a night shift in the pharmacy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve customers, verify prescriptions, and prepare medicines by hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action — from opening a safe to closing a report — could mark the beginning of something strange.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886590/extras/43f8286077ecb18f6243719c9d961a97.avif?t=1771490394\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886590/extras_big/43f8286077ecb18f6243719c9d961a97.webp?t=1771490394 width=1560 height=72 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Eastern European setting: cold fluorescent lights, sterile shelves, and empty streets beyond the windows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stylized world of simplified realism with a dark, minimalist palette.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lingering sense of unease — and the feeling that something is watching you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886590/extras/7f315f630fe74ad3af6bc3ac349c7ae9.avif?t=1771490394\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886590/extras_big/7f315f630fe74ad3af6bc3ac349c7ae9.webp?t=1771490394 width=1560 height=72 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check orders and detect forged prescriptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identify incompatible drugs and decide whether to fulfill the order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform inventory checks and choose whether to report or conceal violations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manually prepare medicines by mixing ingredients in the lab.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert — sounds, random events, and unsettling details change with every shift.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pharma Noctis</strong> is a psychological horror without jump scares, where an ordinary night shift in a pharmacy turns into something disturbing and inevitably frightening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are just a pharmacist. You fill prescriptions, check orders, prepare medicines, and keep records. But as the night drags on, it feels more and more like something is watching you from the darkness.</p><p cl